.TH PVE-TOOLBOX 1 "August 2026" "pve-toolbox" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pve-toolbox \- modular administration toolbox for Proxmox VE hosts
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pve-toolbox
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ command ]
.RI [ module ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pve-toolbox
discovers self-contained administration modules and provides interactive,
full-screen, and command-line interfaces for installing, updating, checking,
reporting, and removing them.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B list [tag]
List modules and their status, optionally filtered by tag.
.TP
.B install module ...
Install or reconfigure modules.
.TP
.B update [module ...]
Update named modules, or every installed module when none is named.
.TP
.B check [module ...]
Check for updates without changing the host.
.TP
.B status [module ...]
Show detailed module status.
.TP
.B doctor
Run a read-only host, cluster, storage, and installed-module health audit.
Exit with status 0 when healthy, 2 when warnings are present, or 1 when a
check fails.
.TP
.B uninstall module ...
Remove modules after confirmation.
.TP
.B ui
Open the full-screen interface. This requires whiptail or dialog.
.TP
.B link
Link a git checkout into standard command and completion paths. Packaged
installs refuse this command.
.TP
.B self-update
Update a git checkout. Packaged installs use apt instead.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-y ", " \-\-yes
Run non-interactively with configured values and defaults.
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-force
Force reinstall or redownload behavior where a module supports it.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Emit versioned, machine-readable output for status, check, or doctor.
.TP
.B \-\-quiet
Emit no report for status, check, or doctor; return only its standardized
status. This cannot be combined with --json.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print the installed version.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print command usage.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 indicates success, 1 an operational failure, 2 a warning, 64 invalid input,
and 69 a report whose meaningful checks are unsupported.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/pve-toolbox/
Runtime-generated module configuration and secrets.
.TP
.I /var/lib/pve-toolbox/
Runtime-generated module state.
.TP
.I /usr/lib/pve-toolbox/
Packaged libraries and modules.
.SH SEE ALSO
Project documentation: https://quwisky.github.io/pve-toolbox/
